i-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F10.70\">10.70</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 10, 2014<br/>Winter Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20141124102246&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Lion_s_Heart_c28e1e.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  the Lion's Heart.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">The amulet looks like a golden lion's head. A hermit in Carlin might tell you more about it.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This item is used to <a href=\"#/wiki/Noble%20Lion%20%28Mount%29\">tame</a> a <a href=\"#/wiki/Noble%20Lion\">Noble Lion</a>. <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Noble%20Lion%20%28Mount%29\"><img alt=\"Noble Lion (Mount)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Noble_Lion_Mount_4277b7.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> It cannot break.<br/> You will receive this item as a reward of the <a href=\"#/quest/lions-rock-quest\">Lion's Rock Quest</a>.<br/>\n<b>Failed</b>:<br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The noble lion fled.</span><br/>\n</p><p><b>Failed</b>: <br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The noble lion majestically rejects your amulet.</span><br/>\n</